{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"y":0.10747938765254628,"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.20987654278891379,"w":0.057613169352213528,"c":1,"t":"Test 2"},{"y":0.1495877502416938,"w":0.26954732259114578,"t":"READING PASSAGE 2","x":0.20987654403021586,"h":0.016195524146054074,"c":1},{"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 14-26, which are based on Reading","y":0.18098029557962247,"c":1,"x":0.20962033372745092,"w":0.72267161051432294,"h":0.022983299408138702},{"t":"Passage 2 below.","y":0.19611307443754289,"h":0.017667844522968212,"w":0.15020576477050782,"x":0.20781892818389661,"c":1},{"y":0.46075581375209695,"w":0.016460905075073223,"t":"B","x":0.20576131690690783,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1},{"y":0.23096089870949554,"w":0.47794647216796876,"x":0.33303973958663219,"h":0.023887676962413229,"c":1,"t":"Back to the future of skyscraper design"},{"t":"Answers to the problem of excessive electricity use by skyscrapers","h":0.021817246651621436,"y":0.26375250441075671,"x":0.27137315759793834,"w":0.60327789306640622,"c":1},{"h":0.022321384281657197,"c":1,"t":"and large public buildings can be found in ingenious but forgotten","x":0.27756622145413984,"y":0.27876499851378811,"w":0.58890192667643237},{"w":0.51440327962239585,"y":0.29651162773741357,"t":"architectural designs of the 19th and early-20th centuries","h":0.017441860778592888,"x":0.31481482074314726,"c":1},{"h":0.019063028486092315,"c":1,"y":0.31946107218183573,"w":0.67923100789388013,"x":0.23444669840982632,"t":"The Recovery of Natural Environments in Architecture by Professor Alan Short is"},{"w":0.66899164835611979,"h":0.019228214088682472,"x":0.24472165043760508,"y":0.33492824304257374,"t":"the culmination of 30 years of research and award-winning green building design","c":1},{"x":0.24679586569244102,"h":0.01894443363688425,"c":1,"y":0.35155536681905941,"t":"by Short and colleagues in Architecture, Engineering, Applied Maths and Earth","w":0.64836298624674482},{"x":0.24659726812039381,"y":0.3643879790936726,"h":0.0197162425981392,"w":0.34017908732096358,"c":1,"t":"Sciences at the University of Cambridge."},{"y":0.39098837194480429,"t":"The crisis in building design is already here,' said Short. 'Policy makers think","w":0.62551442464192708,"h":0.015988372380376759,"c":1,"x":0.2469135693966758},{"y":0.40842167238308191,"h":0.014543444023536689,"t":"you can solve energy and building problems with gadgets. You can't. As global","w":0.63991770426432293,"x":0.24485596254851771,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.24675118477163607,"y":0.42147756259545599,"h":0.018474873159743388,"w":0.68133585611979175,"t":"temperatures continue to rise, we are going to continue to squander more and more"},{"x":0.24485595504487626,"c":1,"y":0.43895348822602276,"h":0.01599350806821509,"t":"energy on keeping our buildings mechanically cool until we have run out of capacity.'","w":0.68930043538411456},{"y":0.46047494681830314,"c":1,"t":"Short is calling for a sweeping reinvention of how skyscrapers and major public","x":0.24268549282212709,"w":0.65454462687174475,"h":0.018226454479815191},{"x":0.24265304729429146,"y":0.47650564693112951,"h":0.019025180308922751,"c":1,"t":"buildings are designed - to end the reliance on sealed buildings which exist solely","w":0.67927586873372392},{"y":0.49148684772904572,"x":0.24472945781882022,"h":0.017566218112186283,"c":1,"t":"via theiạlife support' system of vast air conditioning units.","w":0.46734044392903645},{"y":0.51552141690285413,"w":0.61758107503255211,"x":0.24468958680516362,"t":"Instead, he shows it is entirely possible to accommodate natural ventilation","h":0.018603223793919432,"c":1},{"y":0.53109176179568551,"c":1,"x":0.24475036369156347,"w":0.63189361572265623,"t":"and cooling in large buildings by looking into the past, before the widespread","h":0.018289396984697892},{"c":1,"w":0.67512705485026037,"t":"introduction of air conditioning systems, which were 'relentlessly and aggressively","y":0.54619425758870521,"x":0.24267881913242473,"h":0.01920427113455514},{"x":0.24460854515500338,"y":0.56155629878245428,"c":1,"h":0.01717345032169626,"t":"marketed' by their inventors.","w":0.24125216166178384},{"x":0.23649669784329339,"w":0.66074849446614581,"t":"Short points out that to make most contemporary buildings habitable, they have","h":0.019504414570766904,"c":1,"y":0.58560611354177794},{"h":0.018186914064297288,"t":"to be sealed and air conditioned. The energy use and carbon emissions this","x":0.24470043258760332,"w":0.6237620035807292,"c":1,"y":0.60011600684814259},{"c":1,"w":0.68956125895182296,"x":0.24472538244563471,"h":0.019013455394300105,"t":"generates is spectacular and largely unnecessary. Buildings in the West account for","y":0.6162361648013136},{"c":1,"w":0.68337773640950528,"h":0.020048494192961397,"y":0.63174733336116318,"t":"40-50% of electricity usage, generating substantial carbon emissions, and the rest","x":0.24265663049555125},{"h":0.019416523766040195,"c":1,"w":0.64015314737955731,"t":"of the world is catching up at a frightening rate. Short regards glass, steel and","x":0.24268590380130697,"y":0.64670594402588555},{"y":0.66252848484351334,"c":1,"x":0.2426889374085916,"h":0.018935229387946007,"t":"air-conditioned skyscrapers as symbols of status, rather than practical ways of","w":0.64835744222005198},{"t":"meeting our requirements.","c":1,"w":0.22073941548665363,"x":0.2445861237346145,"h":0.016074912988957024,"y":0.67812796019418597},{"t":"Short's book highlights a developing and sophisticated art and science of ventilating","c":1,"h":0.018943541743589698,"y":0.70174432739337533,"x":0.23033524418169615,"w":0.70188603719075515},{"c":1,"h":0.016851403828363698,"y":0.7178831121507242,"w":0.62772349039713538,"t":"buildings through the 19th and earlier-20th centuries, including the design of","x":0.24476248768985195},{"c":1,"h":0.016682939338459435,"y":0.73251539153708689,"w":0.62165690104166671,"t":"ingeniously ventilated hospitals. Of particular interest were those built to the","x":0.24265874286925926},{"t":"designs of John Shaw Billings, including the first Johns Hopkins Hospital in the US","c":1,"x":0.24269324894587158,"y":0.74798486289469368,"h":0.018502739208747121,"w":0.67716547648111969},{"h":0.01765107940026811,"x":0.24264179756590476,"w":0.25345792134602863,"t":"city of Baltimore (1873-1889).","y":0.76301192362286996,"c":1},{"t":"'We spent three years digitally modelling Billings' final designs,' says Short. 'We","x":0.24268097805094024,"y":0.786073056265023,"h":0.01964387343264018,"c":1,"w":0.65249623616536456},{"x":0.24470399142772029,"y":0.79843976244911841,"w":0.64435038248697918,"h":0.022910886434278743,"c":1,"t":"put pathogens\" in the airstreams, modelled for someone with tuberculosis (TB)"},{"t":"coughing in the wards and we found the ventilation systems in the room would","y":0.8179283288311503,"w":0.64016642252604172,"h":0.017685665539493245,"c":1,"x":0.24472579770525973},{"c":1,"h":0.01629068096057551,"t":"have kept other patients safe from harm.","x":0.24263795778905831,"w":0.33777091979980467,"y":0.83408140777785145},{"c":1,"x":0.24043480379090823,"t":"* pathogens: microorganisms that can cause disease","y":0.85594031231819034,"w":0.28243263244628913,"h":0.015655213166181792},{"h":0.013081394460653373,"x":0.19958847762373622,"t":"42","w":0.024691357612609877,"c":1,"y":0.86482558167592327}]}